Description: GNOME Terminal 3.44 fork with renamable tabs and tab groups
 EasyTerminal is a personal fork of GNOME Terminal 3.44 that adds
 renamable tabs (the name wins over titles set by programs) and named,
 collapsible tab groups managed from the tab context menu.
 .
 It installs next to gnome-terminal and shares nothing with it: own
 application ID (io.github.andreapas79.easyterminal), binaries, settings,
 D-Bus service and systemd user unit.
